-- an unprovable equation paid INSIDE a let body: the obligation's
-- context shows the let as the ONE binding the source wrote — el-let's
-- two entries, the value and its unfolding hypothesis, folded back
-- into an annotated let (The report, conventions)
letObl : (n : ℕ) → ℕ
letObl =
  λn. let m = S n in ((λh. m) : (m ≡ Z ∈ ℕ) → ℕ) ⋆
